              <code className="mx-1">nxeon-backup-*</code> systemd units to a dumpdir
              (<code>{view.platformDir}</code>) that sits <em>outside</em> every Proxmox storage, so
              customer retention can never prune them — which is also why they don&rsquo;t appear in
              the Proxmox archive list below. Read from the status files the units write; no separate
              database.
            </p>
          </div>
          <Badge tone={anyFailed ? "red" : anyMissing ? "amber" : "green"}>
            {anyFailed ? "attention needed" : anyMissing ? "partial" : "healthy"}
